e-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7892"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaszrvb13/"></a><strong>Муддати ўтган умумий қарз</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width:75.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr7893/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7893" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7893"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasmfcx77/"></a><strong>Ташкилотга боғлиқ бўлмаган сабаблар бўйича вужудга келган муддати ўтган қарзлар</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width:6.8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr7894/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7894" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7894"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasrwvlgl/"></a><strong>жами</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="4" style="width:68.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr7895/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7895" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7895"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaszxnirp/"></a><strong>шу жумладан</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:14.2%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr7896/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7896" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7896"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasge8bod/"></a><strong>ҳукумат қарорларига асосан олдиндан ҳақ тўла-май жўнатилган (олинган) маҳсулотлар бўйича муддати ўтган қарзлар</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:19.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr7897/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7897" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7897"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasetg3n9/"></a><strong>давлат ресурслари ва жамғармаларидан жўнатиш кўзда тутилган хом ашё ва материаллар бўйича ўтказилган бўнак тўловлари суммаси</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:16.8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr7898/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7898" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7898"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasgyb49s/"></a><strong>ҳукумат қарорлари бўйича кечиктирилган қарзлар</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:17.5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr7899/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7899" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7899"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasg2mbi5/"></a><strong>қонунчиликка мувофиқ даъволар бўйича суд жараёнида кўриб чиқилаётган ёки иқтисодий суд томонидан кредиторлардан ундириш тўғрисида қарор чиққан қарзлар суммаси</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:6.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr7900/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7900" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7900"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasbbxmib/"></a><strong>1</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:15.4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr7901/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7901" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bs