dfas1taali/"></a><strong>х</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:56.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13938/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13938" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13938"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas6nr1et/"></a>Қайта баҳолаш моделига мувофиқ баҳоланадиган асосий воситалар ва номоддий активлар учун қайта баҳолаш натижасида қийматнинг ўсишидаги ўзгаришлар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:8.5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13939/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13939" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13939"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasreogms/"></a>0710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:8.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13940/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13940" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13940"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasvlgnro/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13941/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13941" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13941"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfast7vy2h/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13942/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13942" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13942"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasvness5/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:56.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13943/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13943" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13943"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas6w76df/"></a>Таъсир остидаги ташкилотлар ва қўшма корхоналарнинг бошқа умумлашган даромадининг (зарарининг) ташкилотга тегишли улуши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:8.5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13944/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13944" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13944"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasck6ev9/"></a>0720</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:8.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13945/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13945" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13945"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasvzycne/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13946/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13946" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13946"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasgs7fgg/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13947/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13947" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13947"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasnsgpk4/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:56.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13948/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13948" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13948"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasskvn8t/"></a>Реклассификация қилинмайдиган моддалар бўйича фойда солиғи таъсирлари</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:8.5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13949/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13949" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13949"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasapag5s/"></a>0730</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:8.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13950/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13950" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13950"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas1ntzow/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13951/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13951" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13951"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas55p0ql/"></a><strong>( )</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13952/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13952" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13952"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaspbmbeg/"></a><strong>( )</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:56.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13953/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13953" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13953"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas5fraqu/"></a><strong>Кейинги даврларда фойда ёки зарарда реклассификация қилинмайдиган бошқа умумлашган даромадлар (фойда солиғи таъсирларини чегирган ҳолда) (сатр. 0710+/-0720-0730)</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:8.5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13954/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13954" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13954"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasrad7ze/"></a><strong>0800</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:8.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13955/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13955" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13955"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas0e7r5z/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13956/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13956" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13956"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas92ydgm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13957/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13957" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13957"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfassym7vo/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:56.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13958/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13958" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13958"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas4bl438/"></a>Чет элдаги бўлинмани бошқа валютага ўтказишда юзага келадиган курс фарқлари</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:8.5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/bssPhr13959/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13959" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13959"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasfrl91l/"></a>0810</p></td><td class="b