document/90/15017/dfas5v7gdy/"></a><strong>Олдинги ҳисобот даври учун бошқа умумлашган даромад, жами (сатр. 0220+/-0230+/-0240+/-0250+/-0260+/-0270+/-0280), шу жумладан:</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:2.25933%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas4odfzh/"></a><strong>0210</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.37263%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasmivhxf/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.60183%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasq41rz1/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.86379%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas00f98g/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.60183%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas3bfcsn/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.05763%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaslf3vws/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:5.53373%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasmgv1or/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:5.53373%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasocdhv0/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaspfc4bs/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:16.1755%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaszhe9ek/"></a>Қайта баҳолаш моделига мувофиқ баҳоланадиган асосий воситалар ва номоддий активлар учун қайта баҳолаш натижасида қийматнинг ўсишидаги ўзгаришлар (солиқ таъсирларини чегирган ҳолда)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:2.25933%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasbgpa68/"></a>0220</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.37263%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas7mls56/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.60183%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasxiia2z/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.86379%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfash2mqoy/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.60183%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas6seg94/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.05763%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasw9g4rh/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:5.53373%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfash84cin/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:5.53373%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasnsgehv/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasws943n/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:16.1755%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas8u2sug/"></a>Таъсир остидаги ташкилотлар ва қўшма корхоналарнинг бошқа умумлашган даромадининг (зарарининг) ташкилотга тегишли улуши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:2.25933%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasu5rf3f/"></a>0