k-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaszamv6s/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:5.53373%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasgyqu4v/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas9uzr69/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:16.1755%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasigk2ge/"></a><strong>Ҳисобот даври учун бошқа умумлашган даромад, жами (сатр. 0430+/-0440+/-0450+/-0460+/-0470+/-0480+/-0490), шу жумладан:</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:2.25933%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfash2pkw5/"></a><strong>0420</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.37263%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasnw3nq4/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.60183%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasn7bbux/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.86379%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasdx1ck9/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.60183%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasmemy76/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.05763%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasmg9pce/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:5.53373%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas8t1rgs/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:5.53373%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas588l2o/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas3d0kie/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:16.1755%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas7mrgqf/"></a>Қайта баҳолаш моделига мувофиқ баҳоланадиган асосий воситалар ва номоддий активлар учун қайта баҳолаш натижасида қийматнинг ўсишидаги ўзгаришлар (солиқ таъсирларини чегирган ҳолда)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:2.25933%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas6xs86g/"></a>0430</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.37263%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas7ovio5/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.60183%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas6a93fg/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.86379%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaslpkv08/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.60183%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas6tdgcf/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.05763%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfass3zapc/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:5.53373%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasp13g1h/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:5.53373%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasp1pvsa/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasdegvzg/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:16.1755%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas0ffd7l/"></a>Таъсир остидаги ташкилотлар ва қўшма корхоналарнинг бошқа умумлашган даромадининг (зарарининг) ташкилотга тегишли улуши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:2.25933%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas1bdx8r/"></a>0440</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.37263%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasfq966r/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.60183%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasprhh1a/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.86379%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasrgpskt/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.60183%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasbk8lhm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.05763%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfascpg166/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:5.53373%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas1nvg8x/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:5.53373%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas206guu/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas4q1pg4/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:16.1755%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasf12043/"></a>Белгиланган тўловлар бўйича пенсия дастурларини қайта баҳолаш натижасида қийматнинг ўсишидаги ўзгаришлар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:2.25933%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas7t30np/"></a>0450</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.37263%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas0zhghr/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.60183%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfassagctf/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.86379%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas2khyxd/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:3.60183%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas7ba9az/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.05763%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaspco26w/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:5.53373%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfash5t6oo/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:5.53373%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas8wwate/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:9.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas62d3uu/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:16.1755%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasux67e9/"></a>Чет элдаги бўлинмани бошқа валютага ўтказишда юзага келадиган курс фарқлари</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:2.25933%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas4