reak-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasggqqwe/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasvl5t6q/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas7r06yh/"></a>(минг сўмда)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasneiovi/"></a><strong>Кўрсаткичлар номи</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas9nfhcm/"></a><strong>Сатр коди</strong>*</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaswkk09y/"></a><strong>Изоҳ</strong>**</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas7gevxm/"></a>(изоҳнинг тартиб рақами)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasy7fmi8/"></a><strong>20___ й. йил учун</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas63bk6m/"></a><strong>20___ й. йил учун</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas0pbok4/"></a><strong>Операцион фаолият бўйича пул оқимлари</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfass7mx6t/"></a><strong>0100</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas2y4hiu/"></a><strong>х</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasnzc8ye/"></a><strong>х</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfash4lwpv/"></a><strong>х</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasztdz2z/"></a>Фойда солиғи тўлангунга қадар фойда (зарар)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasooiwfe/"></a>0110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaslsggqo/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasup6kzg/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasb18e6h/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasndabtv/"></a>Тузатишлар:</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasniqsyb/"></a>0120</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfashwzkdb/"></a><strong>х</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas6a9wih/"></a><strong>х</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas3p4ne2/"></a><strong>х</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas4dmocf/"></a>Молиявий харажатлар (+)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas0xg96d/"></a>0130</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfascxsw1q/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasbbbix6/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasws1tyq/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasdu9hto/"></a>Молиявий даромадлар (-)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas7dof8z/"></a>0140</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasz1l9y6/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasz8i709/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasowvfsn/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaspq5o32/"></a>Активларга ҳисобланган эскириш ва уларнинг қадрсизланиш харажатлари (+)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas88cuw7/"></a>0130</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasq1tw7y/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfashbhobe/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaspn9ga8/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaskqge2i/"></a>Савдо ва бошқа дебиторлик қарзларининг қадрсизланиши (+)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfast1eix3/"></a>0140</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasvxmgt2/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasw3zzbv/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasxn41vr/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasy753k3/"></a>Товар моддий захираларининг қадрсизланиши бўйича харажатлар (+)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasaknmr6/"></a>0150</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasrmchlm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas1irkui/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas5am1s9/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfastdmwgk/"></a>Асосий воситалар ва номоддий активларни ҳисобдан чиқаришдан фойда(-)/ зарар(+)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas29v4hm/"></a>0160</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaskuicmh/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfascepqsm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas7e9o5n/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasgheb13/"></a>Инвестиция кўчмас мулкининг ҳаққоний нархи ўзгаришидан фойда(-)/ зарар(+)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas9w0ftd/"></a>0170</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaszk66xg/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasec6sup/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasta69sd/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasg08hfi/"></a>Валютаси курси фарқидан соф фойда(-)/ зарар(+)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasux1dii/"></a>0180</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas6idnaq/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfascpo2tr/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas2gccn8/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas3lxime/"></a>Баҳоланган мажбуриятлар учун резеврлар бўйича фойда(-)/ зарар(+)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas2fbyhx/"></a>0190</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasd0vkru/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas9cr2g1/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas1nqhw2/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas1uafg2/"></a>Таъсир остидаги ташкилотлар ва қўшма корхоналарнинг фойдасининг (-) (зарарининг)(+) ташкилотга тегишли улуши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas7wy9hp/"></a>0200</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaserc2ok/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasec7dzi/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas1k2ae9/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas3l5251/"></a>Давлат грантлари бўйича даромадлар (-)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas1udgfg/"></a>0210</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasu29ubq/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasgxe5wz/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasfs8t38/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas338bvi/"></a>Операцион фаолиятнинг бошқа нақд пулсиз операцияларига тузатишлар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasile2v1/"></a>0220</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaskobmhi/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasfazqe7/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasdpp7rg/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaslunnlc/"></a><strong>Айланма капиталдаги ўзгаришлар (сатр. 0110+0130-0140+0150+/-0160+/-0170+/-0180+/-0190+/-0200+/-0210+/-0220)</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaswtfdws/"></a><strong>0230</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasxx6sgu/"></a><strong>х</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas23gs5v/"></a><strong>х</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasipre1t/"></a><strong>х</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasq3egkz/"></a>Товар моддий захираларининг ўсиши (-)/ камайиши (+)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasgygx8x/"></a>0240</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasmzxdng/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasyalosa/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasgxa94z/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas02oaua/"></a>Савдо ва бошқа қисқа муддатли дебиторлик қарзларининг ўсиши (-)/ камайиши (+)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasxsb5wn/"></a>0250</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasti8q9k/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas3txxyw/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas3bhtgn/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas514fdg/"></a>Савдо ва бошқа қисқа муддатли кредиторлик қарзларининг ўсиши (+)/ камайиши (-)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas7t1bam/"></a>0260</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfassgvoev/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasa5ad8p/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaseqlwmh/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasvqxw84/"></a>Бошқа қисқа муддатли активларнинг ўсиши (-)/ камайиши (+)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasystc3b/"></a>0270</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasgsl8w8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfask3wpon/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasd3dw9v/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasowa2vu/"></a>Бошқа қисқа муддатли мажбуриятларнинг ўсиши (+)/ камайиши (-)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaso40urx/"></a>0280</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaspx1bbu/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas8t780q/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaszg7774/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasap4ptq/"></a><strong>Операцион фаолиятдан олинган пул маблағлари (сатр. 0230+/-0240+/-0250+/-0260+/-0270+/-0280)</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasgg01aa/"></a><strong>0290</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas1io65s/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas8984bl/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasrzyyb6/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfash2rf0v/"></a>Тўланган фоизлар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasesefbd/"></a>0300</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasl6l2v8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas0x9xph/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaskul8ld/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfass63rhe/"></a>Тўланган фойда солиғи</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasv7a64f/"></a>0310</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasqq1n6g/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas8o6e4s/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasasnau8/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasg337io/"></a><strong>Операцион фаолиятдан соф пул оқимлари (сатр. 0290-0300-0310)</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfashmf2f8/"></a><strong>0320</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas0im7m3/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaspv7lnm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfask0do02/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas6ghav6/"></a><strong>Инвестиция</strong>&#160;<strong>фаолияти бўйича пул оқимлари</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaszbtnrg/"></a><strong>0400</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasktagg2/"></a><strong>х</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasaun41z/"></a><strong>х</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasr81ktl/"></a><strong>х</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasxb4ksa/"></a>Асосий воситалар, номоддий активлар ва бошқа узоқ муддатли активларни сотишдан пул тушуми</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasqb4e9t/"></a>0410</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasm4gd2g/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaszag659/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas32qmf9/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasb9ny2b/"></a>Асосий воситалар, номоддий активлар ва бошқа узоқ муддатли активларнинг хариди учун пул чиқими</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas3apv7d/"></a>0420</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasof0ew2/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas83nquf/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasfigtlg/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasrtyita/"></a>Бошқа ташкилотларнинг улушли ва қарз инструментларини сотишдан пул тушуми</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas5gx804/"></a>0430</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasvi9v79/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasm488w0/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaswgznt1/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas0g0acd/"></a>Бошқа ташкилотларнинг улушли ва қарз инструментларини харид қилиш учун пул чиқими</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaswxpgon/"></a>0440</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas1vv0yn/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfas0kzewm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfaswtrefd/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:61.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasatw0dz/"></a>Олинган давлат грантлари</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfasic2y61/"></a>0450</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:10.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfashdp32p/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:7.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15017/dfask